":"boundary_types","title":"Declared facade functions below shop.app take and return no bare dict or object, and no undeclared type","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"shop.app's functions take and return typed models, never a bare dict standing in for one.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"ASSIGNMENT-COMPLETE","kind":"complete_assignment","title":"Every module in shop belongs to one component","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"A module without one owning component escapes every boundary rule.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"CALL-DESCRIBE-NO-MAINTENANCE","kind":"call_owner","title":"Only declared callers invoke shop.app.maintenance.run_maintenance","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Describing a connection must not run store maintenance.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"COMPONENT-NO-CYCLES","kind":"no_component_cycles","title":"Component dependencies form no cycle","verdict":"FAIL","evaluated":true,"violations":1,"undecided":0,"reason":"violations","rationale":"Components stay layered so each one can be reviewed and replaced in dependency order.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"CONSTRUCT-NO-ANY","kind":"forbidden_construct","title":"shop forbids any_annotation","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"A value that crosses a module boundary carries a type the reader can follow; Any hides exactly what the boundary exists to state.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"CONSTRUCT-NO-ASSERT","kind":"forbidden_construct","title":"shop forbids assert","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Invariants are checked where values are built, because assert statements vanish under python -O.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"CONSTRUCT-NO-BROAD-EXCEPT","kind":"forbidden_construct","title":"shop forbids broad_except","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Failures stay typed and visible; only the CLI error boundary, main's own body, turns any failure into an exit code.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"CONSTRUCT-NO-DYNAMIC","kind":"forbidden_construct","title":"shop forbids getattr, hasattr, cast, eval, exec, dynamic_import, type_ignore, setattr, delattr, vars, dunder_dict","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Static architecture evidence remains explicit and mechanically traceable.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"CONSTRUCT-NO-PLACEHOLDER","kind":"forbidden_construct","title":"shop forbids placeholder_body","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"A function whose body is pass, ellipsis or a lone NotImplementedError reports capability it does not have, and its callers are written against that promise.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"CONSTRUCT-NO-STRING-LITERAL-COMPARE","kind":"forbidden_construct","title":"shop forbids string_literal_compare","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"A closed vocabulary is an enum or Literal the type checker follows; a value compared with a string literal is a vocabulary nobody declared.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-APP-ALLOWS-MODEL","kind":"allowed_dependency","title":"shop.app may depend on shop.model","verdict":"DECLARATION","evaluated":false,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"declaration","rationale":"Use cases construct orders from domain values.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-APP-ALLOWS-STORE","kind":"allowed_dependency","title":"shop.app may depend on shop.store","verdict":"DECLARATION","evaluated":false,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"declaration","rationale":"Use cases persist and load orders through the repository.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"