del","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"The composition root reaches domain values only through the use cases it calls.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-CLI-NO-STORE","kind":"forbidden_dependency","title":"shop.cli must not depend on shop.store","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"The composition root reaches persistence only through the use cases it calls.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-MODEL-ALLOWS-RENDER","kind":"allowed_dependency","title":"shop.model may depend on shop.render","verdict":"DECLARATION","evaluated":false,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"declaration","rationale":"Cycle probe: model temporarily allowed to reach render, for the architecture demo's no_component_cycles coverage.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-MODEL-NO-APP","kind":"forbidden_dependency","title":"shop.model must not depend on shop.app","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Value types remain reusable without depending on the use cases that construct them.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-MODEL-NO-CLI","kind":"forbidden_dependency","title":"shop.model must not depend on shop.cli","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Value types remain independent of command-line composition.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-MODEL-NO-STORE","kind":"forbidden_dependency","title":"shop.model must not depend on shop.store","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Order and Line value types stay independent of any persistence mechanism.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-RENDER-ALLOWS-MODEL","kind":"allowed_dependency","title":"shop.render may depend on shop.model","verdict":"DECLARATION","evaluated":false,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"declaration","rationale":"Text projection reads the values it renders.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-RENDER-NO-APP","kind":"forbidden_dependency","title":"shop.render must not depend on shop.app","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Text projection stays a pure view over values, not a caller of use cases.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-RENDER-NO-CLI","kind":"forbidden_dependency","title":"shop.render must not depend on shop.cli","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Text projection remains reusable without command-line composition.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-RENDER-NO-STORE","kind":"forbidden_dependency","title":"shop.render must not depend on shop.store","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Text projection consumes typed values without touching persistence.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-STORE-ALLOWS-MODEL","kind":"allowed_dependency","title":"shop.store may depend on shop.model","verdict":"DECLARATION","evaluated":false,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"declaration","rationale":"Persistence serialises the domain values it is given.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-STORE-NO-APP","kind":"forbidden_dependency","title":"shop.store must not depend on shop.app","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Persistence stays a leaf dependency and never calls back into use cases.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-STORE-NO-CLI","kind":"forbidden_dependency","title":"shop.store must not depend on shop.cli","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Persistence stays callable without command-line orchestration.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-STORE-NO-MONEY","kind":"forbidden_dependency","title":"shop.store must not depend on shop.model.entities.Money","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Persistence serialises whole orders and must not compute or interpret money amounts itself.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"DEP-STORE-NO-RENDER","kind":"forbidden_dependency","title":"shop.store must not depend on shop.render","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Persistence remains independent of how orders are displayed.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"EFFECT-NO-TOKEN-WHEN-SEEDED","kind":"forbidden_effect_under_condition","title":"Forbid secrets.token_hex while shop.app.tokens.token_for_run.seeded is true","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Seeded runs must return a fixed token and avoid nondeterministic effects.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"EXTERNAL-COMPLETE","kind":"complete_external_scope","title":"Every dependency shop imports is declared","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"A dependency no rule names is a dependency nobody chose, and a package that does not exist looks exactly the same from inside the code.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"EXTERNAL-JSON-STORE","kind":"external_dependency_scope","title":"json is allowed only in shop.store","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Only the store component chooses the JSON file format; other components stay format-agnostic.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"INTERFACE-BOUNDARY","kind":"interface_boundary","title":"Cross-component imports must reach the target's declared public interface","verdict":"PASS","evaluated":true,"violations":0,"undecided":0,"reason":"evaluated","rationale":"Components communicate only through declared interfaces, so reaching into another component's internals requires a visible contract change.","decided_by":"architect"},{"id":"LAYERS-MODEL","kind":"layer_order","title":"Dec